# Introduces tree-like sets

rule: over a deduce a in Set(a);
rule: over a, b deduce a in Set(a, b);
rule: over a, b deduce a in Set(b, a);
rule: over a, b, c given a in b deduce a in Set(b, c);
rule: over a, b, c given a in c deduce a in Set(b, c);

theorem: a in Set(Set(a), Set(b));
theorem: a in Set(Set(b), Set(a));
theorem: a in Set(a);
